      "text": "Crocky the crocodile was sad."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "imagePath": "images/03.jpg",
      "text": "He had no friends to play with."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "imagePath": "images/04.jpg",
      "text": "Babloo, the butterfly said, \"I will play with you, Crocky. Do not cry.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "imagePath": "images/05.jpg",
      "text": "Tutoo, the turtle said, \"I will play with you, Crocky. Do not cry.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "imagePath": "images/06.jpg",
      "text": "Susie, the snake said, \"I will also play with you, Crocky. Do not cry.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "imagePath": "images/07.jpg",
      "text": "Fred, the frog and Fenny, the fish also came to play."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
